#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:144
msgid "Display Settings"
msgstr "Nastavení zobrazení"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:150
msgid "Rendering"
msgstr "Vykreslování"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:155 koassistant_ui/prompts_manager.lua:2263
msgid "View Mode"
msgstr "Režim zobrazení"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:162
msgid ""
"Markdown renders formatting. Plain Text has better font support for Arabic/"
"CJK."
msgstr ""
"Markdown vykresluje formátování. Prostý text má lepší podporu písem pro "
"arabštinu/CJK."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:167
msgid "Latest Reply on New Page"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:170
msgid ""
"Present the newest reply from the top of a fresh page. Markdown chats get a "
"real page break before it (older exchanges stay compact — the break moves "
"forward with each reply and never touches saves or exports); Plain Text "
"chats align the view so the reply starts the screen. Chat viewer only."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:175
msgid "Open Chats at Latest Exchange"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:178
msgid ""
"When opening a saved chat, jump to the newest question and reply instead of "
"the top. Replies always land on the newest exchange regardless of this "
"setting. Independent of New Page per Exchange (that one changes the page "
"layout; this one changes where an opened chat starts)."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:183
msgid "Plain Text Options"
msgstr "Možnosti prostého textu"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:189
msgid "Apply Markdown Stripping"
msgstr "Použít odstranění Markdown"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:192
msgid ""
"Convert markdown syntax to readable plain text (headers, lists, etc). "
"Disable to show raw markdown."
msgstr ""
"Převést markdown syntaxi na čitelný prostý text (nadpisy, seznamy atd.). "
"Vypnutím zobrazíte surový markdown."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:199
msgid "Text Mode for Dictionary"
msgstr "Textový režim pro slovník"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:202
msgid ""
"Use Plain Text mode for dictionary popup. Better font support for non-Latin "
"scripts."
msgstr ""
"Použít režim prostého textu pro vyskakovací okno slovníku. Lepší podpora "
"písem pro neLatinská písma."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:207
msgid "Text Mode for RTL Dictionary"
msgstr "Textový režim pro RTL slovník"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:214
msgid ""
"Use Plain Text mode for dictionary popup when dictionary language is Arabic, "
"Persian, or Urdu. Grayed out when Text Mode for Dictionary is enabled."
msgstr ""
"Použít režim prostého textu pro vyskakovací okno slovníku, když je jazyk "
"slovníku arabština, perština nebo urdu. Zešedlé, když je povolen Textový "
"režim pro slovník."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:219
msgid "Text Mode for RTL Translate"
msgstr "Textový režim pro RTL překlad"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:222
msgid ""
"Use Plain Text mode for translate popup when translation language is Arabic, "
"Persian, or Urdu."
msgstr ""
"Použít režim prostého textu pro vyskakovací okno překladu, když je jazyk "
"překladu arabština, perština nebo urdu."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:234
msgid ""
"Automatically detect RTL content and switch to RTL mode (right-aligned text "
"+ Plain Text). Activates when the latest response has more RTL than Latin "
"characters. Disabling removes all automatic RTL adjustments. Grayed out when "
"markdown is disabled."
msgstr ""
"Automaticky detekovat RTL obsah a přepnout do RTL režimu (text zarovnaný "
"vpravo + Prostý text). Aktivuje se, když má poslední odpověď více RTL než "
"latinských znaků. Vypnutí odstraní všechna automatická RTL nastavení. "
"Zešedlé, když je markdown vypnut."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:241
msgid "Emoji"
msgstr "Emoji"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:246
msgid "Emoji Menu Icons"
msgstr "Ikony emoji v menu"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:249
msgid ""
"Show emoji icons (🔍, 📖) in UI buttons and status indicators. Requires "
"emoji font support in KOReader. Does not work on all devices. If icons "
"appear as question marks, disable this option."
msgstr ""
"Zobrazit ikony emoji (🔍, 📖) v tlačítkách UI a stavových indikátorech. "
"Vyžaduje podporu emoji fontů v KOReader. Nefunguje na všech zařízeních. "
"Pokud se ikony zobrazují jako otazníky, vypněte tuto možnost."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:254
msgid "Emoji Panel Icons"
msgstr "Ikony panelu emoji"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:257
msgid ""
"Show emoji icons on Quick Settings and Quick Actions panel buttons (🔗 "
"Provider, 🎭 Behavior, 📜 Chat History, etc.). Requires emoji font support."
msgstr ""
"Zobrazit emoji ikony na tlačítkách panelů Rychlé nastavení a Rychlé akce (🔗 "
"Poskytovatel, 🎭 Chování, 📜 Historie chatu atd.). Vyžaduje podporu emoji "
"fontů."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:262
msgid "Emoji Data Access Indicators"
msgstr "Indikátory přístupu k datům pomocí emoji"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:265
msgid ""
"Show emoji indicators on action names showing what data they access: 📄 "
"document text, 🔖 highlights, 📝 annotations, 📓 notebook, 📚 library, 🌐 "
"web search. Requires emoji font support."
msgstr ""
"Zobrazit indikátory emoji u názvů akcí označující, k jakým datům přistupují: "
"📄 text dokumentu, 🔖 záložky, 📝 anotace, 📓 zápisník, 📚 knihovna, 🌐 "
"webové vyhledávání. Vyžaduje podporu písma emoji."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:272
msgid "Panel Alignment"
msgstr "Zarovnání panelu"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:277
msgid "Align Quick Settings"
msgstr "Zarovnat Rychlé nastavení"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:280
msgid ""
"Left-align button text in the Quick Settings panel instead of centering. "
"Also available from the panel's gear menu."
msgstr ""
"Zarovnat text tlačítek na panelu Rychlé nastavení doleva místo na střed. "
"Dostupné také z nabídky ozubeného kola panelu."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:285
msgid "Align Quick Actions"
msgstr "Zarovnat Rychlé akce"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:292
msgid ""
"Left-align button text in the Quick Actions panel instead of centering. Also "
"available from the panel's gear menu."
msgstr ""
"Zarovnat text tlačítek na panelu Rychlé akce doleva místo na střed. Dostupné "
"také z nabídky ozubeného kola panelu."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:299
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Zvýraznění"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:304
msgid "Hide Highlighted Text"
msgstr "Skrýt zvýrazněný text"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:311
msgid "Hide Long Highlights"
msgstr "Skrýt dlouhá zvýraznění"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:319
msgid "Long Highlight Threshold"
msgstr "Práh pro dlouhá zvýraznění"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:333
msgid "Plugin UI Language"
msgstr "Jazyk UI pluginu"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:336
msgid ""
"Language for plugin menus and dialogs. Does not affect AI responses. "
"Requires restart."
msgstr ""
"Jazyk pro nabídky a dialogy pluginu. Neovlivňuje odpovědi AI. Vyžaduje "
"restart."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:338
msgid "Match KOReader"
msgstr "Shodovat s KOReader"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:376
msgid "Please restart KOReader for the language change to take effect."
msgstr "Pro provedení změny jazyka prosím restartujte KOReader."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:387
msgid "Chat & Export Settings"
msgstr "Nastavení chatu a exportu"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:393
msgid "Auto-save All Chats"
msgstr "Automaticky ukládat všechny chaty"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:400
msgid "Auto-save Continued Chats"
msgstr "Automaticky ukládat pokračující chaty"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:410
msgid "Streaming"
msgstr "Streamování"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:415 koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1440
#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1546
msgid "Enable Streaming"
msgstr "Povolit streamování"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:422
msgid "Auto-scroll Streaming"
msgstr "Automatické posouvání při streamování"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:426
msgid ""
"Follow the arriving text while a response streams. Scrolling up pauses the "
"follow for that response so you can read in place while the rest arrives; "
"the Autoscroll button in the streaming window turns it back on."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:431
msgid "Keep Reading Position"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:435
msgid ""
"If auto-scroll is off or paused and you are reading while the response "
"streams, the finished chat opens where you were reading instead of at the "
"newest reply. In Markdown it opens on the page containing your spot; in "
"Plain Text your spot starts the view."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:440
msgid "Page-based Scroll (e-ink)"
msgstr "Posouvání založené na stránkách (e-ink)"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:447
msgid ""
"Stream text into empty page space instead of scrolling from the bottom. "
"Reduces full-screen refreshes on e-ink. Disable for continuous bottom-"
"scrolling."
msgstr ""
"Streamovat text do prázdného prostoru stránky místo posouvání zdola. Omezuje "
"celoplošné obnovení na e-ink. Zakažte pro nepřetržité posouvání zdola."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:452
msgid "Large Stream Dialog"
msgstr "Velký dialog pro stream"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:460
msgid "Stream Poll Interval (ms)"
msgstr "Interval dotazování streamu (ms)"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:467
msgid ""
"How often to check for new stream data.\n"
"Lower = snappier but uses more battery."
msgstr ""
"Jak často kontrolovat nová data streamu.\n"
"Nižší = rychlejší, ale používá více baterie."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:473
msgid "Display Refresh Interval (ms)"
msgstr "Interval obnovení zobrazení (ms)"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:480
msgid ""
"How often to refresh the display during streaming.\n"
"Higher = better performance on slower devices."
msgstr ""
"Jak často obnovovat zobrazení během streamování.\n"
"Vyšší = lepší výkon na pomalejších zařízeních."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:492
msgid "Quick Answer Preset"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:497
msgid "Quick Answer On by Default"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:500
msgid ""
"Start new chats with the Quick Answer (⚡) button already on. You can still "
"turn it off per chat: and override the default per book from Book Settings "
"or the ⚡ button's menu."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:515
msgid ""
"How strongly Quick Answer asks for brevity: Standard requests a short, "
"direct reply (a few sentences, no preamble); Ultra-brief enforces a hard "
"ceiling (at most 3 short sentences, one plain paragraph, never restate the "
"question); Off sends no brevity instruction."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:522
msgid "Turn Reasoning Off"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:525
msgid ""
"Disable model reasoning/thinking for Quick Answer chats (models that can't "
"disable it drop to their lowest level). A one-shot reasoning pick in the "
"Quick chip's menu overrides this."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:530
msgid "Turn Web Search Off"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:537
msgid "Turn Book Tools Off"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:544
msgid "Skip Domain Lens"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:547
msgid ""
"Leave the selected domain lens out of Quick Answer chats. Off by default: "
"the domain shapes identity rather than length, and costs almost nothing in "
"speed."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:552
msgid "Skip Book Background"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:555
msgid ""
"Leave the per-book Background note out of Quick Answer chats. Off by "
"default: the Background frames how you read this book, and costs almost "
"nothing in speed."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:565
msgid ""
"Optionally change the AI behavior while Quick Answer is on: keep the current "
"one (default), swap to its Mini variant (same style family when one exists), "
"pin a specific behavior (the built-in Terse suits Quick Answer), or send "
"none at all. Actions that pin a behavior are unaffected."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:587
msgid "Model override: %1"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:589
msgid ""
"Optionally switch models while Quick Answer is on (that chat only: your "
"default model is untouched): the active provider's fastest listed model, a "
"tier of the active provider, or a pinned specific model. Custom providers "
"keep the current model unless custom_models.lua gives them tier placements. "
"A one-shot model pick in the Quick chip's menu overrides this."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:604
msgid ""
"On by default: the AI is told not to reveal events beyond your current "
"reading position in book and highlight chats, and X-Ray checkpoint updates "
"follow your position instead of installing the newest version. Research mode "
"disables protection. Override per book in Book Settings; per chat via the "
"Spoiler chip (chat input's gear menu → Toolbar Buttons). Custom actions can "
"use the {spoiler_free_nudge} placeholder."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:609
msgid "Book Info in Chat"
msgstr "Informace o knize v chatu"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:618
msgid ""
"Default book context sent with freeform chats and book-aware actions "
"(Explain, etc.). 'None' sends no book line; 'Title only' omits the author; "
"'Title & author' is the default; 'Title, author & position' also adds "
"reading progress, chapter, and page (when basic stats are enabled). Override "
"per book in Book Settings. Actions that don't request book info (e.g. "
"Translate) are unaffected."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:625 koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1866
msgid "Content Format"
msgstr "Formát obsahu"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:630
msgid "Export Style"
msgstr "Styl exportu"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:637
msgid ""
"Markdown uses # headers and **bold**. Plain text uses simple formatting."
msgstr ""
"Markdown používá # nadpisy a **tučné**. Prostý text používá jednoduché "
"formátování."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:646 koassistant_settings_schema.lua:661
#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:677 koassistant_settings_schema.lua:693
#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:713 koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1413
#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1429 koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1567
#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1583
msgid "Ask every time"
msgstr "Zeptat se vždy"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:652
msgid "What to include when copying chat to clipboard."
msgstr "Co zahrnout při kopírování chatu do schránky."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:667
msgid "What to include when saving to note."
msgstr "Co zahrnout při ukládání do poznámky."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:672
msgid "Save to File Content"
msgstr "Uložit do obsahu souboru"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:676 koassistant_settings_schema.lua:692
msgid "Follow Copy Content"
msgstr "Následovat obsah kopírování"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:683
msgid ""
"What to include when saving chat to file. 'Follow Copy Content' uses your "
"Copy Content setting."
msgstr ""
"Co zahrnout při ukládání chatu do souboru. „Sledovat obsah kopie\" použije "
"vaše nastavení Obsahu kopie."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:688
msgid "Chat History Export"
msgstr "Export historie chatu"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:699
msgid "What to include when exporting from Chat History."
msgstr "Co zahrnout při exportu z historie chatu."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:707 koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1893
msgid "Save Location"
msgstr "Umístění uložení"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:711
msgid "KOAssistant exports folder"
msgstr "Složka exportů KOAssistant"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:712 koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1899
msgid "Custom folder"
msgstr "Vlastní složka"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:721
msgid ""
"Where to save exported chat files. Creates subfolders for book/general/multi-"
"book chats.\n"
"\n"
"Default folder:\n"
"%1\n"
"\n"
"Custom folder:\n"
"%2"
msgstr ""
"Kam ukládat exportované soubory chatu. Vytvoří podsložky pro chaty ke knize/"
"obecné/více knih.\n"
"\n"
"Výchozí složka:\n"
"%1\n"
"\n"
"Vlastní složka:\n"
"%2"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:723
msgid ""
"Where to save exported chat files. Creates subfolders for book/general/multi-"
"book chats.\n"
"\n"
"Default folder:\n"
"%1"
msgstr ""
"Kam ukládat exportované soubory chatu. Vytvoří podsložky pro chaty ke knize/"
"obecné/více knih.\n"
"\n"
"Výchozí složka:\n"
"%1"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:739
msgid "Save book chats alongside books"
msgstr "Ukládat konverzace o knize vedle knih"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:742
msgid ""
"When enabled, book chats are saved to a 'chats' subfolder next to the book "
"file instead of the central location."
msgstr ""
"Když je zapnuto, konverzace o knize jsou ukládány do podsložky 'chats' vedle "
"souboru knihy místo do centrálního umístění."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:754
msgid "Reading & Library"
msgstr "Čtení a knihovna"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:763
msgid "Chapter Quiz: %1"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:770
msgid "Quiz on Chapter End"
msgstr "Kvíz na konci kapitoly"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:773
msgid ""
"Offer a comprehension quiz when you finish reading a chapter. Requires a "
"book with a table of contents."
msgstr ""
"Nabídnout kvíz porozumění po dočtení kapitoly. Vyžaduje knihu s obsahem."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:778
msgid "Quiz Chapter Level"
msgstr "Úroveň kapitoly pro kvíz"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:788
msgid ""
"Which TOC level counts as a 'chapter' for end-of-chapter quizzes. A fixed "
"level falls back to the deepest level the book actually has. 'Auto-detect' "
"picks the deepest level whose chapters are at least the minimum length "
"below. 'All TOC headings' follows KOReader's TOC tick settings. Short or "
"skimmed chapters are skipped by the length setting below."
msgstr ""
"Která úroveň obsahu se počítá jako „kapitola\" pro kvízy na konci kapitoly. "
"Pevná úroveň se vrátí k nejhlubší úrovni, kterou kniha skutečně obsahuje. "
"„Automatická detekce\" vybere nejhlubší úroveň, jejíž kapitoly mají alespoň "
"minimální délku uvedenou níže. „Všechna záhlaví obsahu\" sleduje nastavení "
"značek obsahu KOReaderu. Krátké nebo prolistované kapitoly jsou přeskočeny "
"na základě nastavení délky níže."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:794
msgid "Minimum Chapter Length (pages)"
msgstr "Minimální délka kapitoly (stránky)"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:801
msgid ""
"Skip the chapter-end quiz for chapters shorter than this many pages (0 = no "
"minimum). Also sets the threshold 'Auto-detect' uses to pick the chapter "
"level. Can be overridden per book in Book Settings."
msgstr ""
"Přeskočit kvíz na konci kapitoly pro kapitoly kratší než zadaný počet "
"stránek (0 = žádné minimum). Také nastavuje práh, který „Automatická "
"detekce\" používá pro výběr úrovně kapitoly. Lze přepsat pro každou knihu v "
"Nastavení knihy."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:807
msgid "Minimum Reading Time (minutes)"
msgstr "Minimální doba čtení (minuty)"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:814
msgid ""
"Skip the chapter-end quiz unless you spent at least this many minutes "
"reading the chapter (0 = no minimum). Catches flipping quickly through a "
"long chapter. Uses KOReader's reading statistics; if those are unavailable "
"the quiz is still offered. Can be overridden per book in Book Settings."
msgstr ""
"Přeskočit kvíz na konci kapitoly, pokud jste strávili čtením kapitoly méně "
"než tento počet minut (0 = žádné minimum). Zachytí rychlé listování dlouhou "
"kapitolou. Používá statistiky čtení KOReaderu; pokud nejsou dostupné, kvíz "
"je přesto nabídnut. Lze přepsat pro jednotlivé knihy v Nastavení knihy."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:820
msgid "Question Count"
msgstr "Počet otázek"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:827
msgid "Total number of questions to generate per quiz."
msgstr "Celkový počet otázek generovaných pro každý kvíz."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:832
msgid "Difficulty"
msgstr "Obtížnost"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:840
msgid ""
"Easy: straightforward recall. Medium: comprehension and application. Hard: "
"analysis and synthesis."
msgstr ""
"Snadná: přímočaré vybavení. Střední: porozumění a aplikace. Těžká: analýza a "
"syntéza."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:845
msgid "Include Multiple Choice"
msgstr "Zahrnout výběr z více možností"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:852
msgid "Include Short Answer"
msgstr "Zahrnout krátkou odpověď"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:859
msgid "Include Discussion"
msgstr "Zahrnout diskusi"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:875
msgid "Automatic X-Ray (all books)"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:878
msgid ""
"Automatically build and maintain every book's X-Ray as you read (flowing "
"formats like EPUB only): a spoiler-free introduction first, then checkpoints "
"at chapter-sized steps, always keeping the next checkpoint ready ahead of "
"you; reaching it installs it instantly and the one after starts building. "
"Individual books can override this either way: X-Ray popup or Book Settings "
"→ Automatic X-Ray; a per-book On works even with this off, and a per-book "
"Off always wins.\n"
"\n"
"Spend guards: at most one background build per cooldown, WiFi only, and text-"
"extraction consent (or a trusted provider) required; background runs extract "
"book text and use API tokens without a per-request tap. Leave off if every "
"request should be explicit."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:900
msgid "Also Start X-Rays Automatically"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:903
msgid ""
"A sub-setting of Automatic X-Ray (all books), for books that have NO X-Ray "
"yet: allow automation to make the FIRST build (introduction + checkpoints to "
"your position; the first build asks how you want coverage, once per book). "
"With this off, \"all books\" automation only maintains X-Rays you started "
"yourself. Books with an existing non-incremental X-Ray (complete, AI-"
"knowledge, legacy) are never touched.\n"
"\n"
"Books switched to Automatic individually (per-book On) always build the "
"first one, regardless of this setting."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:909
msgid "First Build for New Books"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:913
msgid "Ask each book"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:914
msgid "Catch up, then follow"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:915
msgid "Build all checkpoints"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:917
msgid ""
"How Automatic X-Ray handles its first build for a book. \"Ask each book\" "
"shows a one-time choice per book. \"Catch up, then follow\" quietly builds "
"checkpoints to your position and keeps one ahead. \"Build all checkpoints\" "
"offers the full checkpoint build with its cost confirmation. The ask "
"dialog's \"Always do this, for every book\" writes this setting too."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:922
msgid "Offer Automatic X-Ray for New Books"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:925
msgid ""
"When you open a book that has no X-Ray, ask once whether to turn on "
"Automatic X-Ray for it. Only asks when it could act right away (flowing "
"format, text-extraction consent in place). Declining turns the book's "
"Automatic X-Ray off, so it never asks again for that book."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:934
msgid "Cooldown (minutes)"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:941
msgid "Minimum time between background checkpoint builds (0 = no cooldown)."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:947
msgid "Notify on Background Activity"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:950
msgid ""
"Show a brief notification when a background X-Ray update or create starts "
"and completes, and when a checkpoint is silently swapped in. Off = fully "
"silent (the X-Ray popup always shows the current coverage)."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:956
msgid "Checkpoints at Chapter Ends"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:959
msgid ""
"When building X-Ray checkpoints, place each checkpoint at the nearest "
"chapter end (within a few percent) instead of an exact percentage; "
"checkpoints then read as \"up to the end of a chapter\", and the versions "
"list shows the chapter names. Needs a table of contents. Checkpoint spacing "
"itself adapts to book length: about every 10% of a normal-length book, "
"larger steps for short ones."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:964
msgid "Categories for New X-Rays"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:966
msgid ""
"Which category groups a new X-Ray tracks by default: everything, or a "
"narrower pick like character tracking. Applies when an X-Ray is created or "
"rebuilt; individual books can pick their own categories in Book Settings."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:971
msgid "Shorter Update Requests"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:974
msgid ""
"When updating an X-Ray (manually or through checkpoints), send the model "
"only the most recent entries of the ever-growing event lists (timeline, "
"argument development) instead of the whole lists, which makes updates "
"noticeably cheaper on long books. The stored X-Ray always keeps all entries; "
"this only shortens what is sent. In rare cases the model may re-add an old "
"event it can no longer see."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:979
msgid "X-Ray Entry for Matching Selections"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:982
msgid ""
"When a tapped word or selected text exactly matches an X-Ray entity's name "
"or alias, open that X-Ray entry directly — skipping ahead of the dictionary "
"and the highlight menu (including any bypass actions you have set there). "
"Anything that doesn't match falls through to your normal dictionary/"
"highlight behavior. Only does anything for books that have an X-Ray. A very "
"long press at the end of a selection always shows the normal highlight menu."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1000
msgid ""
"Discreetly underline words on the page that match an X-Ray entity's name or "
"alias, as you read (dotted gray, drawn shortly after the page settles; "
"entirely on-device). Tap a marked word to open its entry. Only active for "
"books that have an X-Ray. EPUB page mode only."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1013
msgid "Tap Marked Words to Open"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1016
msgid ""
"With passive marking on, a plain tap on a marked word opens its X-Ray entry, "
"like a link (real links in the text still win). Off = marks are visual only; "
"a long press still opens matching entries via \"X-Ray Entry for Matching "
"Selections\"."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1032
msgid ""
"Let marking, matching selections and entity cards recognize entities that "
"first appear past your installed X-Ray coverage, using the checkpoint "
"already built ahead of you. Identification only: such names get short-dash "
"marks and a brief card, and the full entry stays behind a spoiler "
"confirmation. Off = the plugin only knows entities up to your installed "
"coverage."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1045
msgid "Entity Card First"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1048
msgid ""
"Exact entity hits (tapping a marked word, or selecting text that matches an "
"entity) open a compact card first: the name, category and role, and a one-"
"line identification, with the full entry a tap on the card away. The "
"identification may come from the newest built checkpoint, so newly appearing "
"names are known on sight — the full entry stays at your reading position, "
"behind a confirmation, while spoiler protection is on. Off = open the full "
"entry directly."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1065
msgid "Footnote Panel"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1066
msgid "Floating Popup"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1068
msgid "Card Style: %1"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1073
msgid "Footnote panel (bottom of the screen)"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1074
msgid "Floating popup (near the tapped word)"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1076
msgid ""
"How the entity card is presented. The footnote panel slides in at the bottom "
"of the screen, like KOReader's footnote popups, and follows the book's "
"margins and font size. The floating popup is a small window anchored next to "
"the tapped word. In both, tapping the card opens the full entry; tapping "
"elsewhere dismisses it."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1085
msgid "All Occurrences"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1086
msgid "Once per Page"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1087
msgid "After 10 Unseen Pages"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1088
msgid "After 25 Unseen Pages"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1089
msgid "First Appearance Only"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1091
msgid "Marking Density: %1"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1097
msgid "Only after 10 unseen pages"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1098
msgid "Only after 25 unseen pages"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1102
msgid ""
"How often an entity gets marked. Once per page marks its first occurrence on "
"every page it appears. The unseen-pages options re-mark it only after it has "
"been absent that long, so newly returning names stand out while constant "
"companions stay quiet. First appearance marks it once in the whole book; all "
"occurrences marks every one."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1119
msgid "All Entities"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1120
msgid "People Only"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1121
msgid "People & Places"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1123
msgid "Mark: %1"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1130
msgid "People and places"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1132
msgid ""
"Which kinds of X-Ray entities get marked on the page. People covers "
"characters and key figures; places adds locations."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1148
msgid "Chapter Appearances Rows: %1"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1149
msgid "KOReader ToC Settings"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1149
msgid "Compact"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1154
msgid "Compact (20 rows per page)"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1155
msgid "Follow KOReader's ToC settings"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1157
msgid ""
"Row density for the Chapter Appearances tree in the X-Ray browser. Compact "
"fits 20 rows per page; the other option follows KOReader's own Table of "
"Contents items-per-page and font-size settings."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1163
msgid "X-Ray Versions to Keep"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1170
msgid ""
"Whenever an update or redo overwrites the X-Ray, the outgoing version is "
"archived: browse, view, or restore them via \"All versions\" in the X-Ray "
"popup and browser menu. This sets how many are kept per book (oldest dropped "
"first). 0 stops archiving new versions; already-archived ones stay until you "
"delete them or the X-Ray itself. Checkpoints are stored separately and are "
"never trimmed by this."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1179
msgid ""
"Mirrors the Spoiler Protection setting in Chat & Export Settings. It also "
"lives here because it steers X-Ray updates: when on, checkpoint installs "
"follow your reading position; when off, the newest built checkpoint installs "
"right away. Override per book in Book Settings (the Spoiler Protection and X-"
"Ray updates rows)."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1187
msgid "Recap Reminder"
msgstr "Připomenutí rekapitulace"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1192
msgid "Remind to Recap on Book Open"
msgstr "Připomenout rekapitulaci při otevření knihy"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1195
msgid ""
"Show a reminder to run Recap when you open a book you haven't read in a "
"while."
msgstr ""
"Zobrazit připomenutí ke spuštění rekapitulace při otevření knihy, kterou "
"jste dlouho nečetli."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1200
msgid "Days Before Reminder"
msgstr "Počet dní před připomenutím"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1207
msgid "Number of days since last reading before the reminder appears."
msgstr ""
"Počet dní od posledního čtení, po jehož uplynutí se zobrazí připomenutí."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1215
msgid "End of Book"
msgstr "Konec knihy"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1220
msgid "Suggest Next Read on Finish"
msgstr "Navrhnout další četbu po dokončení"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1223
msgid ""
"When you reach the end of a book, offer to suggest what to read next from "
"your library. Requires library scanning to be enabled with at least one "
"folder configured."
msgstr ""
"Když dosáhnete konce knihy, nabídne návrh, co číst dál z vaší knihovny. "
"Vyžaduje povolené skenování knihovny s alespoň jednou nakonfigurovanou "
"složkou."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1235 koassistant_settings_schema.lua:2051
msgid "Allow Library Scanning"
msgstr "Povolit skenování knihovny"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1238
msgid ""
"Enables library actions that analyze your book collection. Add permanent "
"scan folders below, or pick folders on the fly in the input dialog."
msgstr ""
"Povoluje akce knihovny, které analyzují vaši knižní sbírku. Přidejte trvalé "
"složky pro skenování níže nebo vyberte složky za chodu v dialogu zadávání."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1244
msgid ""
"Enables library actions that analyze your book collection.\n"
"\n"
"Add permanent scan folders below, or pick folders on the fly in the input "
"dialog."
msgstr ""
"Povoluje akce knihovny, které analyzují vaši knižní sbírku.\n"
"\n"
"Přidejte trvalé složky pro skenování níže nebo vyberte složky za chodu v "
"dialogu zadávání."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1256
msgid "Permanent Scan Folders: None"
msgstr "Trvalé složky pro skenování: Žádné"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1258
msgid "Permanent Scan Folders: %1"
msgstr "Trvalé složky pro skenování: %1"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1262
msgid ""
"Folders always scanned for library actions. You can also pick folders on the "
"fly in the input dialog."
msgstr ""
"Složky vždy skenované pro akce knihovny. Složky lze také vybrat za chodu v "
"dialogu zadávání."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1272
msgid "AI Language Settings"
msgstr "Nastavení jazyka AI"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1292
msgid "Your Languages: %1 (auto)"
msgstr "Vaše jazyky: %1 (auto)"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1294
msgid "Your Languages: (not set)"
msgstr "Vaše jazyky: (nenastaveno)"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1296 koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1303
msgid "Your Languages: %1"
msgstr "Vaše jazyky: %1"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1313
msgid "Primary Language: (not set)"
msgstr "Primární jazyk: (nenastaveno)"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1315
msgid "Primary Language: %1"
msgstr "Primární jazyk: %1"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1326
msgid "Additional Languages: (none)"
msgstr "Další jazyky: (žádné)"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1333
msgid "Additional Languages: %1"
msgstr "Další jazyky: %1"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1344
msgid "Dictionary Settings"
msgstr "Nastavení slovníku"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1356
msgid "Response Language: (Follow Translation)"
msgstr "Jazyk odpovědi: (Podle překladu)"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1358
msgid "Response Language: (Follow Primary)"
msgstr "Jazyk odpovědi: (Podle primárního)"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1360
msgid "Response Language: %1"
msgstr "Jazyk odpovědi: %1"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1377
msgid "Context Mode: %1"
msgstr "Režim kontextu: %1"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1380
msgid ""
"How much text around the looked-up word is sent with dictionary actions. The "
"Ctx button on the dictionary popup toggles it per lookup; Book Settings can "
"override it per book."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1385 koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1746
msgid "Context Characters"
msgstr "Znaky kontextu"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1391
msgid ""
"Number of characters to include before/after the word when Context Mode is "
"'Characters'"
msgstr ""
"Počet znaků, které se mají zahrnout před/za slovem, když je režim kontextu "
"'Znaky'"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1400
msgid "Disable Auto-save for Dictionary"
msgstr "Zakázat automatické ukládání pro slovník"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1403
msgid ""
"When enabled, dictionary lookups are not auto-saved. When disabled, "
"dictionary chats follow your general chat saving settings. You can always "
"save manually from an expanded view."
msgstr ""
"Když je zapnuto, vyhledávání ve slovníku se automaticky neukládají. Když je "
"vypnuto, konverzace slovníku následují vaše obecná nastavení ukládání "
"konverzací. Vždy můžete uložit ručně z rozbaleného zobrazení."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1412 koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1428
#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1566 koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1582
msgid "Follow global setting"
msgstr "Následovat globální nastavení"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1416 koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1432
msgid "Definition only (Recommended)"
msgstr "Pouze definice (Doporučeno)"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1419
msgid "What to include when copying in dictionary view."
msgstr "Co zahrnout při kopírování v zobrazení slovníku."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1435
msgid "What to include when saving dictionary results to a note."
msgstr "Co zahrnout při ukládání výsledků slovníku do poznámky."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1443
msgid ""
"Stream dictionary responses in real-time. Disable to wait for complete "
"response."
msgstr ""
"Streamovat odpovědi slovníku v reálném čase. Zakažte pro čekání na úplnou "
"odpověď."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1448
msgid "Bypass KOReader Dictionary"
msgstr "Obejít slovník KOReader"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1451
msgid ""
"Skip KOReader's dictionary and go directly to AI when tapping words. Can "
"also be toggled via gesture."
msgstr ""
"Přeskočit slovník KOReader a jít přímo na AI při klepnutí na slova. Lze také "
"přepnout pomocí gesta."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1472 koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1476
#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1478 koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1777
#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1781 koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1783
msgid "Bypass Action: %1"
msgstr "Akce obejití: %1"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1481
msgid ""
"Action to trigger when dictionary bypass is enabled. With X-Ray Lookup, a "
"tapped word that has an X-Ray entry opens it directly; any other word falls "
"through to the normal dictionary."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1486
msgid "Bypass: Follow Vocab Builder Auto-add"
msgstr "Obejití: Následovat automatické přidávání do Tvůrce slovní zásoby"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1489
msgid ""
"When enabled, dictionary bypass follows KOReader's Vocabulary Builder auto-"
"add setting. Disable if you use bypass for analysis of words you already "
"know and don't want them added."
msgstr ""
"Když je zapnuto, obejití slovníku následuje nastavení automatického "
"přidávání do Tvůrce slovní zásoby KOReader. Zakažte, pokud používáte obejití "
"pro analýzu slov, která již znáte, a nechcete, aby byla přidána."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1498
msgid "Translate Settings"
msgstr "Nastavení překladu"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1505
msgid "Translate to Primary Language"
msgstr "Překládat do primárního jazyka"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1508
msgid ""
"Use your primary language as the translation target. Disable to choose a "
"different target."
msgstr ""
"Použít váš primární jazyk jako cíl překladu. Zakažte pro výběr jiného cíle."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1528
msgid "Translation Target: %1"
msgstr "Cíl překladu: %1"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1538
msgid "Disable Auto-Save for Translate"
msgstr "Zakázat automatické ukládání pro překlad"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1541
msgid "Translations are not auto-saved. Save manually via → Chat button."
msgstr ""
"Překlady se automaticky neukládají. Uložte ručně pomocí tlačítka → "
"Konverzace."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1549
msgid "Stream translation responses in real-time."
msgstr "Streamovat odpovědi překladu v reálném čase."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1554
msgid "Include Surrounding Context"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1557
msgid ""
"Send the text around the highlight along with translations, so the AI can "
"resolve pronouns, tone, and ambiguous words. Uses the Surrounding Context "
"mode from Highlight Settings (sentence when that is off). Never applies to "
"full-page translation."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1573
msgid "What to include when copying in translate view."
msgstr "Co zahrnout při kopírování v zobrazení překladu."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1589
msgid "What to include when saving to note in translate view."
msgstr "Co zahrnout při ukládání do poznámky v zobrazení překladu."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1601
msgid "Follow Global"
msgstr "Sledovat globální"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1602 koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1612
msgid "Always Hide"
msgstr "Vždy skrýt"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1603
msgid "Hide Long"
msgstr "Skrýt dlouhé"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1604 koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1614
msgid "Never Hide"
msgstr "Nikdy neskrývat"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1606
msgid "Original Text: %1"
msgstr "Původní text: %1"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1611
msgid "Follow Global (Display Settings)"
msgstr "Sledovat globální (nastavení zobrazení)"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1613
msgid "Hide Long (by character count)"
msgstr "Skrýt dlouhé (podle počtu znaků)"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1620
msgid "Long Text Threshold"
msgstr "Práh pro dlouhý text"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1626
msgid ""
"Character count above which text is considered 'long'. Used when Original "
"Text is set to 'Hide Long'."
msgstr ""
"Počet znaků, nad kterým je text považován za 'dlouhý'. Používá se, když je "
"Původní text nastaven na 'Skrýt dlouhé'."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1635
msgid "Hide for Full Page Translate"
msgstr "Skrýt pro překlad celé stránky"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1638
msgid ""
"Always hide original text for full page translations. Overrides all other "
"visibility settings when enabled. Disable to use your normal Original Text "
"setting above."
msgstr ""
"Vždy skrýt původní text u překladů celé stránky. Přepíše všechna ostatní "
"nastavení viditelnosti, když je zapnuto. Vypněte pro použití běžného "
"nastavení Původní text výše."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1653
msgid "Minimal Popup View"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1660 main.lua:6004
msgid "When it fits"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1661 main.lua:6005
#: koassistant_ui/prompts_manager.lua:876
#: koassistant_ui/prompts_manager.lua:900
#: koassistant_ui/prompts_manager.lua:1873
#: koassistant_ui/prompts_manager.lua:2406
#: koassistant_ui/prompts_manager.lua:3605
#: koassistant_ui/prompts_manager.lua:4579
msgid "Always"
msgstr "Vždy"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1663
msgid ""
"Show responses from the actions below in a small popup next to the "
"highlighted text: just the response, no buttons. Tap the popup to open the "
"full window; tap outside to dismiss. 'When it fits' shows the popup only "
"when the whole response fits inside it; longer responses open the full "
"window directly. 'Always' shows the popup regardless, trimmed with an "
"ellipsis. Streaming is skipped for these requests. Never applies to full-"
"page translation."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1673
msgid "Actions Using Minimal Popup: %1"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1676
msgid ""
"Which highlight actions open in the minimal popup. Translate and Quick "
"Define by default."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1685
msgid "Highlight Settings"
msgstr "Nastavení zvýraznění"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1691
msgid "Surrounding Context"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1695
msgid "None (off)"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1700
msgid ""
"Automatically send the text around a highlight with highlight questions and "
"actions, so the AI sees the passage in context. Capped at 2000 characters. "
"Dictionary lookups and actions with their own scope selection are "
"unaffected. Can be overridden per book in Book Settings."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1705
msgid "Context Direction"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1710
msgid "Before the selection only"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1712
msgid ""
"Which side of the selection surrounding context is taken from. Also applies "
"to dictionary context. While spoiler protection is on for a book, the after "
"side is additionally limited by the next setting."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1717
msgid "Context Under Spoiler Protection"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1721
msgid "Nothing after the selection"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1722
msgid "To the end of its sentence"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1723
msgid "To the end of its paragraph"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1726
msgid ""
"How far past the selection context may reach while spoiler protection is on. "
"The context window can otherwise include up to 1000 characters after the "
"selection, which may be text you have not read yet; the sentence or "
"paragraph you are selecting from is on the page in front of you. Applies to "
"highlight and dictionary context."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1731
msgid "Context Paragraphs"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1737
msgid ""
"Number of paragraphs to include on each side of the highlight when "
"Surrounding Context is 'Paragraph(s)'. 1 = the paragraph containing the "
"highlight."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1752
msgid ""
"Number of characters to include before/after the highlight when Surrounding "
"Context is 'Characters'."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1762
msgid "Enable Highlight Bypass"
msgstr "Povolit obejití zvýraznění"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1765
msgid ""
"Immediately trigger an action when text is selected, skipping the highlight "
"menu. Can also be toggled via gesture."
msgstr ""
"Okamžitě spustit akci při výběru textu, přeskočit nabídku zvýraznění. Lze "
"také přepínat pomocí gesta."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1786
msgid "Action to trigger when highlight bypass is enabled"
msgstr "Akce ke spuštění, když je zapnuto obejití zvýraznění"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1797 main.lua:22266
msgid "Actions & Prompts"
msgstr "Akce a výzvy"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1816
msgid "Manage Behaviors (%1)"
msgstr "Správa chování (%1)"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1819
msgid ""
"Select or create AI behavior styles that define how the AI communicates."
msgstr ""
"Vyberte nebo vytvořte styly chování AI, které definují, jak AI komunikuje."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1824
msgid "Manage Domains..."
msgstr "Správa oborů…"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1826
msgid "Manage knowledge domains. Domains are selected per-chat."
msgstr "Správa znalostních oborů. Obory se vybírají pro každý chat."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1839
msgid "Default Domain & Research (%1)"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1842
msgid ""
"The default domain and research mode for AI requests. Individual books can "
"override both in Book Settings."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1851
msgid "Notebook Settings"
msgstr "Nastavení zápisníků"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1859
msgid "Browse Notebooks..."
msgstr "Procházet zápisníky…"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1871
msgid "Q&A"
msgstr "Otázky a odpovědi"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1872
msgid "Full Q&A (recommended)"
msgstr "Úplné otázky a odpovědi (doporučeno)"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1874
msgid ""
"What to include when saving to notebook.\n"
"Q&A includes the highlighted text + your question + the response. Full Q&A "
"adds anything you attached with the paperclip (notes, artifacts, chats, "
"files)."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1879
msgid "Viewer Mode"
msgstr "Režim prohlížení"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1883
msgid "Chat Viewer"
msgstr "Prohlížeč chatu"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1884
msgid "KOReader"
msgstr "KOReader"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1886
msgid ""
"Chat Viewer shows notebook with editing and export buttons. KOReader opens "
"as a full document with navigation."
msgstr ""
"Prohlížeč chatu zobrazuje zápisník s tlačítky pro úpravy a export. KOReader "
"otevírá jako plný dokument s navigací."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1897
msgid "Alongside book"
msgstr "Vedle knihy"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1898
msgid "KOAssistant notebooks folder"
msgstr "Složka zápisníků KOAssistant"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1907
msgid ""
"Where to save notebook files.\n"
"\n"
"Alongside book: in the book's sidecar directory (current default).\n"
"\n"
"KOAssistant notebooks folder:\n"
"%1\n"
"\n"
"Custom folder:\n"
"%2"
msgstr ""
"Kam ukládat soubory zápisníků.\n"
"\n"
"Vedle knihy: v doprovodném adresáři knihy (aktuální výchozí nastavení).\n"
"\n"
"Složka zápisníků KOAssistant:\n"
"%1\n"
"\n"
"Vlastní složka:\n"
"%2"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1909
msgid ""
"Where to save notebook files.\n"
"\n"
"Alongside book: in the book's sidecar directory (current default).\n"
"\n"
"KOAssistant notebooks folder:\n"
"%1\n"
"\n"
"Custom folder: choose your own location (e.g. an Obsidian vault)."
msgstr ""
"Kam ukládat soubory zápisníků.\n"
"\n"
"Vedle knihy: v doprovodném adresáři knihy (aktuální výchozí nastavení).\n"
"\n"
"Složka zápisníků KOAssistant:\n"
"%1\n"
"\n"
"Vlastní složka: zvolte vlastní umístění (např. trezor Obsidian)."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1944 main.lua:22263
msgid "Privacy & Data"
msgstr "Soukromí a data"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1955 main.lua:20154
msgid "Trusted Providers: None"
msgstr "Důvěryhodní poskytovatelé: Žádní"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1957 main.lua:20156
msgid "Trusted Providers: %1"
msgstr "Důvěryhodní poskytovatelé: %1"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1960
msgid ""
"Providers you trust bypass all data sharing controls below AND text "
"extraction. All data types (highlights, annotations, notebook, book text) "
"are available without toggling individual settings. Use for local Ollama "
"instances or providers you fully trust.\n"
"\n"
"Trust also satisfies the consent that background features (such as Automatic "
"X-Ray and X-Ray checkpoint builds) check before running; those can then "
"extract text and spend tokens without a per-request tap."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1968
msgid "Preset: Default"
msgstr "Předvolba: Výchozí"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1969
msgid ""
"Recommended balance. Share reading progress and chapter info for context-"
"aware features. Personal content (highlights, annotations, notebook) stays "
"private."
msgstr ""
"Doporučená rovnováha. Sdílí průběh čtení a informace o kapitolách pro funkce "
"s kontextovým povědomím. Osobní obsah (zvýraznění, poznámky, zápisník) "
"zůstává soukromý."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1976
msgid "Preset: Minimal"
msgstr "Předvolba: Minimální"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1977
msgid ""
"Maximum privacy. Disable all extended data sharing including progress and "
"chapter info. Only your question and book metadata are sent."
msgstr ""
"Maximální soukromí. Zakáže veškeré rozšířené sdílení dat včetně průběhu a "
"informací o kapitolách. Odesílána je pouze vaše otázka a metadata knihy."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1984
msgid "Preset: Full"
msgstr "Předvolba: Úplná"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1985
msgid ""
"Enable all data sharing for full functionality. Does not enable text "
"extraction (see Text Extraction submenu)."
msgstr ""
"Povolí veškeré sdílení dat pro plnou funkcionalitu. Nepovoluje extrakci "
"textu (viz podnabídka Extrakce textu)."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1994
msgid "Tip: Per-book overrides"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:1995 main.lua:20046
msgid ""
"Every sharing toggle here can be overridden per book (Book Settings → "
"Privacy). Two patterns: keep a global toggle off and allow it for specific "
"books, or keep it on and deny it for sensitive books. A per-book deny always "
"wins — even over trusted providers."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:2003
msgid "Allow Annotation Notes"
msgstr "Povolit poznámky k anotacím"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:2006
msgid ""
"Share your personal notes attached to highlights with the AI. Automatically "
"enables highlight sharing. Used by Analyze Notes, Connect with Notes, and "
"actions with {annotations} placeholders."
msgstr ""
"Sdílet osobní poznámky připojené k záložkám s umělou inteligencí. "
"Automaticky povolí sdílení záložek. Používáno funkcemi Analyzovat poznámky, "
"Propojit s poznámkami a akcemi se zástupnými symboly {annotations}."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:2022
msgid "Allow Highlights"
msgstr "Povolit zvýraznění"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:2025
msgid ""
"Share your highlighted text passages with the AI. Used by X-Ray, Recap, and "
"actions with {highlights} placeholders. Does not include personal notes."
msgstr ""
"Sdílejte své zvýrazněné textové pasáže s AI. Používáno funkcemi X-Ray, "
"Rekapitulace a akcemi se zástupnými symboly {highlights}. Nezahrnuje osobní "
"poznámky."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:2035
msgid "Allow Notebook"
msgstr "Povolit zápisník"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:2038
msgid ""
"Send notebook entries to AI. Used by Connect with Notes and actions with "
"{notebook} placeholder."
msgstr ""
"Odeslat záznamy z zápisníku AI. Používá Propojit s poznámkami a akce se "
"zástupným symbolem {notebook}."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:2043
msgid "Allow Basic Stats"
msgstr "Povolit základní statistiky"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:2046
msgid ""
"Send reading progress (percentage), current chapter title, chapters read "
"count, and time since last opened. Used by X-Ray, Recap."
msgstr ""
"Odesílat průběh čtení (procenta), název aktuální kapitoly, počet přečtených "
"kapitol a čas od posledního otevření. Používáno funkcemi X-Ray a Recap."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:2054
msgid ""
"Enables library actions that analyze your book collection. Configure "
"permanent scan folders in Reading & Library, or pick folders on the fly in "
"the input dialog."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:2060
msgid ""
"Enables library actions that analyze your book collection.\n"
"\n"
"Configure permanent scan folders in Reading & Library, or pick folders on "
"the fly in the input dialog."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:2068
msgid "Allow Advanced Stats"
msgstr "Povolit pokročilé statistiky"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:2071
msgid ""
"Share reading engagement data with AI. Includes curated groups based on "
"reading time and completion patterns (e.g. books read extensively, stalled "
"reads, briefly started)."
msgstr ""
"Sdílet data o zapojení do čtení s AI. Zahrnuje kurátorské skupiny založené "
"na době čtení a vzorcích dokončení (např. rozsáhle čtené knihy, pozastavená "
"čtení, krátce zahájená)."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:2081
msgid "Text Extraction (enabled)"
msgstr "Extrakce textu (povolena)"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:2083
msgid "Text Extraction (disabled)"
msgstr "Extrakce textu (zakázána)"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:2090
msgid "Allow Text Extraction"
msgstr "Povolit extrakci textu"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:2093
msgid ""
"When enabled, actions can extract and send book text to the AI. Used by X-"
"Ray, Recap, and actions with text placeholders.\n"
"\n"
"This consent also covers background features you opt into separately (such "
"as Automatic X-Ray and X-Ray checkpoint builds): those extract text and "
"spend API tokens without a per-request confirmation, within their own size "
"guards. Revoking this consent stops them.\n"
"\n"
"Tip: Use Hidden Flows to exclude front matter, appendices, etc. You can also "
"focus actions on a specific section or section range to extract only a "
"chapter or part; for X-Ray, checkpoints cover the book in bounded "
"incremental steps."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:2106
msgid ""
"Text extraction sends actual book content to the AI. This uses tokens "
"(increases API costs) and processing time. Features like X-Ray and Recap use "
"this to analyze your reading progress.\n"
"\n"
"Background features you opt into separately (such as Automatic X-Ray) will "
"also extract text without asking per request.\n"
"\n"
"Tip: Use Hidden Flows to exclude front matter, appendices, etc. You can also "
"focus actions on a specific section or section range to extract only a "
"chapter or part; for X-Ray, checkpoints cover the book in bounded "
"incremental steps."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:2114
msgid "Max Text Characters"
msgstr "Max. znaků textu"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:2121
msgid ""
"Maximum characters to extract (100,000-10,000,000). Higher = more context "
"but more tokens. Default: 4,000,000 (~1M tokens). The API will reject "
"requests that exceed the model's context window.\n"
"\n"
"Tip: Use Hidden Flows to exclude irrelevant content, or focus on a specific "
"section instead of the full document."
msgstr ""
"Maximální počet znaků k extrakci (100 000–10 000 000). Více = větší kontext, "
"ale více tokenů. Výchozí: 4 000 000 (~1M tokenů). API zamítne požadavky "
"překračující kontextové okno modelu.\n"
"\n"
"Tip: Pomocí skrytých toků vyloučíte irelevantní obsah nebo se zaměřte na "
"konkrétní sekci místo celého dokumentu."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:2127
msgid "Max Pages (PDF, DJVU, CBZ…)"
msgstr "Max. stránek (PDF, DJVU, CBZ…)"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:2134
msgid ""
"Maximum pages to extract from page-based formats like PDF, DJVU, and CBZ "
"(100-5,000). Higher = more context but slower. Default: 2,000.\n"
"\n"
"Tip: Use Hidden Flows to exclude irrelevant pages, or focus on a specific "
"section instead of the full document."
msgstr ""
"Maximální počet stránek k extrakci ze stránkových formátů jako PDF, DJVU a "
"CBZ (100–5 000). Více = větší kontext, ale pomalejší zpracování. Výchozí: 2 "
"000.\n"
"\n"
"Tip: Pomocí skrytých toků vyloučíte irelevantní stránky nebo se zaměřte na "
"konkrétní sekci místo celého dokumentu."

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:2140
msgid "Don't warn about truncated extractions"
msgstr "Nevarovat před zkrácenou extrakcí"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:2143
msgid ""
"When unchecked, a blocking warning is shown before sending requests when "
"extracted text was truncated to fit the character limit. Shows coverage "
"percentage so you know how much of the book was included.\n"
"\n"
"Background runs (Automatic X-Ray, checkpoint builds) never show this "
"warning: a truncated background extraction aborts the run instead of sending "
"dishonest coverage.\n"
"\n"
"Check this if you don't need the reminder."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:2149
msgid "Don't warn about large extractions"
msgstr "Nevarovat před velkou extrakcí"

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:2152
msgid ""
"When unchecked, a warning is shown before sending requests with large text "
"extractions (over 500K characters / ~125K tokens). Most models have smaller "
"context windows and will reject oversized requests.\n"
"\n"
"Background runs (Automatic X-Ray, checkpoint builds) never show this "
"warning; their size is bounded instead: automatic updates by the Maximum "
"Progress Gap, checkpoints by their incremental steps.\n"
"\n"
"Check this if you know your model's limits and don't need the reminder."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:2158 main.lua:17572
msgid "Delete Book Artifacts"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:2159
msgid ""
"Delete every saved artifact for the current book: the X-Ray (with its "
"archived versions and checkpoints), summaries, analyses and wiki entries. "
"They regenerate from scratch next time you run the actions."
