"folders. Only these folders are ever scanned, and only when a rebuild runs. "
"Folders that don't exist on this device are skipped.\n"
"\n"
"Note: a settings reset clears this list."
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:2535
msgid "Auto-Rebuild on Startup"
msgstr ""

#: koassistant_settings_schema.lua:2538
msgid ""
