"\n"
"Supported providers: %1.\n"
"\n"
"Gemini supports it only on Search-grounding-capable models; OpenAI on GPT-5 "
"models and xAI on Grok-4 models (via their Responses APIs); OpenRouter works "
"for any model via the :online suffix.\n"
"\n"
"Perplexity searches BY DEFAULT (its native behavior) — the Web toggle can "
"now actually turn it off per chat or per book.\n"
"\n"
